@@ -15,3 +15,13 @@ language.

 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Sites
+
+Requests select a site with the case-insensitive `X-Larder-Site` header,
+which defaults to `main` when absent. An unknown site returns HTTP 400 with
+code `unknown_site`. Batches (including waste and receiving), stock on hand,
+cooking, alerts, stock value and stock-takes use only that site's locations.
+A batch or stock-take in another site is treated as missing; a location in
+another site returns `unknown_location`. Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes
+are shared across sites.
