 - Fridges must read at or below 5 °C and freezers at or below -15 °C. Each
   of them needs at least one reading per day.
 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## Sites (schema 3)
+
+- `sites` contains string `id` and `name` records. Every location has a `site`
+  referring to a site id; batches and stock-takes belong to that site through
+  their location. Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared.
+- Schema 2 migrates to schema 3 by adding the `main` site and assigning all
+  existing locations to it. Schema 1 migrates through schema 2 first.
